	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r07r0103_ol__02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あいを　あたえない　にんげんが
ポケモンや　ひとから▽
あいを　もとめては　いけないのね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:16:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:16:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>愛を　与えない　人間が
ポケモンや　人から▽
愛を　求めては　いけないのね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:16:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:16:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・セイガイハ新婚イベント
・メッセージ表示後、階段前から移動</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:00:26" />
		</CommentCell>
